  "question": "Within a radius of 90 kilometers, where can I locate fast food restaurant on the journey from J P Riddle Stadium, Fayetteville, NC to Silk Hope Ruritan Club, Siler City, NC?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-78.909681 35.008472)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-79.370946 35.780428)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE amenity = 'fast_food'\nAND ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-78.909681 35.008472)',4326)::geography, 90000)\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-78.909681 35.008472)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5);\n",
